+mutation is explicitly unsupported. Sequential `SSL_clear()`, profile weakening,
+or a fresh handshake is detected by re-deriving and comparing the peer SPKI and
+exporter before service or record use. OpenSSL itself recommends a fresh handle
+for each connection rather than recycling a connected handle.
